00:12:23.075 --> 00:12:24.076 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Yeah.
- To rebuild.

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:25.711
Now I want to caution everybody,

00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:28.147
most of Southwest Florida
is back up and running.

00:12:28.147 --> 00:12:31.150
You know, our restaurants are
open, our businesses are open,

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.885
