out right now as we speak.

00:12:45.164 --> 00:12:46.365
- [Rubin] Yeah, yep.

00:12:46.365 --> 00:12:47.900 align:start size:84% position:16%
- But our barrier
islands, our beaches,

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.002
