but we'll be back on track,

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:58.844
it's gonna be fine.

00:12:58.844 --> 00:13:00.713
It's just gonna take
time and some patience.

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:03.015 align:start size:97% position:3%
Now I think we have the
leadership to get that done.

00:13:03.015 --> 00:13:04.717 align:start size:97% position:3%
Obviously Governor DeSantis
at the head of that

00:13:04.717 --> 00:13:06.185 align:start size:84% position:16%
has been phenomenal.
- Yeah.

00:13:06.185 --> 00:13:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Our local leadership
has done a tremendous job.

00:13:08.254 --> 00:13:12.291 align:start size:97% position:3%
