what do you wanna do

00:14:20.693 --> 00:14:23.095
after being congressman
for a couple of terms?

00:14:23.095 --> 00:14:24.330
What's the plan man?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.432
We're in DC, we have a governor

00:14:26.432 --> 00:14:28.334
