00:14:44.483 --> 00:14:45.651 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Ah.
- I'll leave it at that.

00:14:45.651 --> 00:14:47.953 align:start size:84% position:16%
- All right, I
like it, I like it.

00:14:47.953 --> 00:14:49.421
Good seeing you, man.
